OL,3,GNEWSAChildren 'missing out' - SEN
OL,4,Apupils lose taxis days before new
OL,5,Aschool term
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mother of a girl with special
OL,8,Feducational needs has said the
OL,9,FEducation Authority (EA) needs to be
OL,10,Fheld to account after her daughter was
OL,11,Fleft without transport ahead of the new
OL,12,Fschool year.
OL,14,FLaura McDonnell's eight-year-old
OL,15,Fdaughter Evie had previously been
OL,16,Fprovided with a taxi for the 40-mile
OL,17,Fround trip from her home in Londonderry
OL,18,Fto Rossmar Special School in Limavady.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
