OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChildren 'missing out' - SEN
OL,4,Apupils lose taxis days before new
OL,5,Aschool term
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut last week the family were told a
OL,8,Ftaxi is no longer available as the EA
OL,9,Fhad put the taxi contract out to
OL,10,Ftender. The BBC has asked the EA for
OL,11,Fcomment.
OL,13,F"I just felt so let down and frustrated
OL,14,Fand unsupported by the system,"
OL,15,FMcDonnell said.
